<title>USA: Pennsylvania Enterprises Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Pennsylvania Enterprises Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WILKES-BARRE, Pa. 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.86     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,057     loss	 4,159</p>
<p> Revs			19,354		   13,547</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,811		    5,755</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.20     loss	 $0.76</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,439     loss	 4,327</p>
<p> Revs		     123,698		  111,826</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,214		    5,715</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.87   profit	 $0.03</p>
<p> Net profit		 6,054   profit	   650</p>
<p> Revs		     173,816		  161,209</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,351		    5,671</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The full name of the company is Pennsylvania Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>1996 periods include a $1.1 million charge related to termination of debt.</p>
<p>1996 nine month and 12 month periods include charges of $386,000 and $516,000, respectively, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 nine month period includes a charge of $3.7 million from discontinued operations. 1995 12 month period includes a charge of $835,000 from discontinued operations.</p>
</text>
